{"path":"experimental/fpext4","title":"Floating-point extensions part 4: supplementary functions","titleHtml":"Floating-point extensions part 4: supplementary functions","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/experimental/fpext4","section":"experimental","kind":"index","summary":"Floating-point extensions for C - Part 4: Supplementary functions, ISO/IEC TS 18661-4:2015, defines the following new components for the C standard library, as recommended by ISO/IEC/IEEE 60559:2011 (the current revision of IEEE-754).","html":"<p>Floating-point extensions for C - Part 4: Supplementary functions, ISO/IEC TS 18661-4:2015, defines the following new components for the C standard library, as recommended by ISO/IEC/IEEE 60559:2011 (the current revision of IEEE-754).\n</p><p>Supplemenatary mathematical functions listed below are merged into C2x standard.\n</p>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <h5 id=\"Predefined_feature_test_macros\">Predefined feature test macros </h5>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span>__STDC_IEC_60559_FUNCS__</span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   integer constant of type <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">long</span></span></code> and value <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"nu0\">201506L</span></span></code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(macro constant)</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <h5 id=\"Supplementary_mathematical_functions\">Supplementary mathematical functions </h5>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math\"><code>&lt;math.h&gt;</code></a></code> </div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>exp2m1 exp2m1f exp2m1l</span><span>exp2m1fN exp2m1fNx</span><span>exp2m1dN exp2m1dNx</span></span></div><div><span class=\"t-l